!! _POC-XRSVC XR01(XRv9000 26.1.1)= PE。コアの IS-IS と LDP だけ。サービスは PoC の段で足す。
interface Loopback0
 ipv4 address 10.255.0.1 255.255.255.255
!
interface {{ links[3] }}
 description CORE to P1
 ipv4 address 10.0.1.1 255.255.255.0
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[4] }}
 description to CE4 (site 4)
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 is-type level-2-only
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0001.00
 log adjacency changes
 address-family ipv4 unicast
  metric-style wide
 !
 interface Loopback0
  passive
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
 interface {{ links[3] }}
  point-to-point
  address-family ipv4 unicast
  !
 !
!
mpls ldp
 interface {{ links[3] }}
 !
!
end
